      hv' : Quiver.Hom { unop := SimpleGraph.finsubgraphOfAdj e } { unop := SimpleGr …
      ⊢ F.Adj (((G.finsubgraphHomFunctor F).map hv (u { unop := SimpleGraph.finsubgr …
    -/
    refine Hom.map_adj (u (Opposite.op (finsubgraphOfAdj e))) ?_
    -- `v` and `v'` are definitionally adjacent in `finsubgraphOfAdj e`
